follow-redirects' Proxy-Authorization header kept across hosts — When using [axios](https://github.com/axios/axios), its dependency follow-redirects only clears authorization header during cross-domain redirect, but allows the proxy-authentication header which contains credentials too.

## Steps To Reproduce & PoC

